OL,12,G1700 Rise of the Nazis
OL,13,     FThe Home Front: Facing defeat on
OL,14,     Fthe Eastern Front, Hitler elects
OL,15,     Fto retreat to Germany - deep rifts
OL,16,     Femerge, his inner circle vies for
OL,17,     Fpower, and an enemy within plots
OL,18,     Fto kill Hitler.
